5D4 GUI Lifecycle — Hardware Checkpoint 1
==========================================

Classification: HARDWARE CHECKPOINT
Target: Canon EOS 5D Mark IV, firmware 1.3.3
Hardware: physical camera

Baseline src/menu.c SHA-256:
6408dad4d4312d8b97a2a19f2b5821774aaa795fc8346a80bbd27e8d059e9fc4

Result src/menu.c SHA-256:
380e101dc58df773755b7dc5991f1ab43e7baab486675c5b14260676029c619a

This patch preserves the exact C4-v2 source delta validated on hardware.
TESTLV/TESTGM identifiers and diagnostic instrumentation remain present;
removing them would create an untested derivative. Cleanup must be built
and hardware-regression-tested as a separate follow-up checkpoint.

Validated scope includes Electronic Level, normal shooting, INFO Quick
Control and LiveView menu lifecycle, input ownership and clean restoration.
Known half-shutter, display-off and auto-off/wake limitations are documented
in docs/5D4_PORT_STATUS.md.

